---
import Home from "../layouts/home.astro";
import Socials from "../components/ui/socials.astro";
import ResumeIcon from "../components/icons/resume.astro";
import DiscordIcon from "../components/icons/discord.astro";
---

<Home>
	<section class="about-section">
		<div class="intro-section">
			<div class="intro-w-resume">
				<p>hey, i'm shivang.</p>
				<p>here's my resume:</p>
				<div class="resume-icon">
					<a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
						<ResumeIcon />
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p>i'm a cs undergrad trying to get better at backend and low-level programming. basically, figuring out how things work under the hood while still building stuff people can actually use.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="socials-row">
			<span class="socials-label">here are my socials:</span>
			<Socials />
		</div>

		<div class="intro-section">
			<p>lately i've been spending more time understanding systems, memory, performance, tooling.</p>
			<p>
				i also write <a class="blog-link" href="/notes">technical blogs</a><span> </span>
				whenever i build something or stumble onto something worth sharing.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-section">
			<p>
				if you want to collaborate, discuss ideas, or just point out something i got wrong, feel free to reach out:<span> </span>
				<a class="email-link" href="mailto:hey@seivarya.in">hey@seivarya.in</a>
			</p>
			<p>
				outside of programming, i'm probably reading random blogs/books, watching <span class="tsoding-link"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/tsoding">tsoding</a></span> or something else. i have a bunch of social links around here somewhere, but i'm not active on most of them. if you want a quick reply, <span class="discord-row"
					><a class="discord-link" href="https://discord.com/users/1345276369566699530" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">discord</a><span class="icon discord-container"><DiscordIcon /></span></span
				> is your best bet.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Home>
<style>
	.about-section {
		margin: auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.intro-section {
		margin-top: 20px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		width: 100%;
		margin-bottom: 0px;
	}

	.contact-section {
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.contact-section {
			margin-bottom: 10px;
		}
	}

	.intro-section p,
	.contact-section p {
		margin: 0 0 15px 0;
	}

	.contact-section p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.intro-w-resume {
		display: flex;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.resume-icon {
		padding-top: 1.7px;
		width: 24px;
		height: 24px;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease;
	}

	.resume-icon:hover {
		transform: scale(1.1);
	}

	.resume-svg {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		display: block;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.resume-icon {
			width: 16px;
			height: 16px;
			padding-top: 0px;
			transform: translateY(-1.9px) scale(0.94);
		}
	}

	.socials-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: row;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 12px;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.socials-label {
		color: var(--color-text-main);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.contact-section a,
	.contact-section a:visited,
	.contact-section a:active,
	.tsoding-link,
	.tsoding-link:visited,
	.tsoding-link:active {
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
		padding-bottom: 1px;
		font-weight: 500;
		opacity: 0.85;
		transition:
			border-bottom-color 0.25s ease,
			opacity 0.25s ease;
	}

	.contact-section a:hover,
	.contact-section a:focus,
	.tsoding-link:hover,
	.tsoding-link:focus {
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.contact-section .email-link {
		color: var(--color-text-main);
		border-bottom-color: var(--color-link-underline);
	}

	.contact-section .email-link:hover {
		border-bottom-color: var(--color-text-main);
	}

	.tsoding-link {
		color: var(--color-text-main);
		border-bottom-color: var(--color-link-underline);
	}

	.tsoding-link:hover {
		border-bottom-color: var(--color-text-main);
	}

	.contact-section .discord-link {
		color: var(--color-brand-discord);
		border-bottom-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand-discord) 30%, transparent);
	}

	.contact-section .discord-link:hover {
		border-bottom-color: var(--color-brand-discord);
	}

	.discord-row {
		display: inline-flex;
		flex-direction: row;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		vertical-align: middle;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.icon {
		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 14px;
		cursor: default;
		transition: all 0.25s ease;
	}

	.icon svg {
		width: 28px;
		height: 28px;
		fill: currentColor;
	}

	.discord-container {
		color: var(--color-brand-discord);
	}

	.discord-container svg {
		object-fit: contain;
		transform: scale(1.6);
	}
</style>
